        "id": 8238,
        "name": "waedens",
        "username": "waedens",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-19T13:15:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have the Sidekick App (one of the best gamer apps around by the way) and we were using it last night when I had an idea. The sidekick is great for tracking villain targets. What if the App also kept track of start of turn and end of turn effects. Under the HP it could have a start of turn in neon green block letters and end of turn in bright red, ect. &nbsp;It would really help tracking things which is what the sidekick app does best! Anyway I have no idea how hard it would be to do, but it is my vote for an upgrade.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:42.872Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
